plying for a Bahrain student visa. It covers visa types, validity rules, fees in INR, eligibility criteria, required documents, and work rights while studying. With a fast processing time and straightforward requirements, Bahrain is becoming an accessible option for higher education in the Gulf region.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/bahrain-student-visa-for-indian-students-full-details-on-fees-documents-eligibility/articleshow/123949647.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/bahrain-student-visa-for-indian-students-full-details-on-fees-documents-eligibility/articleshow/123949647.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T21:16:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123949968,imgsize-1013916.cms"/></item><item><title>Show is over: Saudi Arabia shuts down music lounges in Riyadh, Jeddah after conservative backlash; cites health, hygiene code</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123949746.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/middle-east-news/show-is-over-saudi-arabia-shuts-down-music-lounges-in-riyadh-jeddah-after-conservative-backlash-cites-health-hygiene-code/articleshow/123949746.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/nri/middle-east-news/show-is-over-saudi-arabia-shuts-down-music-lounges-in-riyadh-jeddah-after-conservative-backlash-cites-health-hygiene-code/articleshow/123949746.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T21:14:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123949857,imgsize-40534.cms"/></item><item><title>'Get off the iPad': Air traffic controller scolds pilot; flight flew close to Air Force One</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123949081.cms" /&gt;A Spirit Airlines pilot faced reprimand from air traffic control for delayed responses to instructions while Air Force One was nearby. The controller, frustrated by the pilot's inattentiveness, ordered him to "get off the iPad." Despite the incident, Spirit Airlines defended its crew, emphasizing their adherence to procedures and prioritizing safety during the flight.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/get-off-the-ipad-air-traffic-controller-scolds-spirit-pilot-flight-flew-close-to-air-force-one/articleshow/123949081.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/get-off-the-ipad-air-traffic-controller-scolds-spirit-pilot-flight-flew-close-to-air-force-one/articleshow/123949081.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T20:59:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123949579,imgsize-29030.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Tariffs a mistake’: Bolton urges India-US talks; slams Donald Trump's 'incoherent' approach</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123948590.cms" /&gt;John Bolton criticized Trump's tariffs on India as a mistake that complicated negotiations and advocated for resuming talks to reduce tariffs and rebuild trust. He highlighted the importance of the Quad in countering China-Russia alignment. Bolton also noted Pakistan's statement regarding Trump's lack of involvement in de-escalating tensions after the Kashmir attack.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tariffs-a-mistake-bolton-urges-india-us-talks-slams-donald-trumps-incoherent-approach/articleshow/123948590.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tariffs-a-mistake-bolton-urges-india-us-talks-slams-donald-trumps-incoherent-approach/articleshow/123948590.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T20:06:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI News Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123948641,imgsize-537724.cms"/></item><item><title>New US citizenship test revealed: Passing score remains same, but more questions added to guide</title><description/><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-us-citizenship-test-revealed-passing-score-remains-same-but-more-questions-added-to-guide/articleshow/123948612.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/new-us-citizenship-test-revealed-passing-score-remains-same-but-more-questions-added-to-guide/articleshow/123948612.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T20:13:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123948793,imgsize-36198.cms"/></item><item><title>'Insensitive, incendiary': Cleveland fire chief sent on leave for Charlie Kirk post</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123948175.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/insensitive-incendiary-cleveland-fire-chief-sent-on-leave-for-charlie-kirk-post-mayor-orders-probe/articleshow/123948175.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/insensitive-incendiary-cleveland-fire-chief-sent-on-leave-for-charlie-kirk-post-mayor-orders-probe/articleshow/123948175.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-17T20:05:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123948560,imgsize-1459414.cms"/></item><item><title>Why 